# Airtight Alibi on a suspected, tapped creature. J. Jonah Jameson (2/2) suspects himself on turn 3 and attacks on turn 5 (tapped, still suspected).
# In Main 2 Bot1 casts the Alibi on him: the enters trigger untaps him, he gains hexproof until end of turn and is no longer suspected (CR 701.60),
# and the Aura gives +2/+2 (4/4). On Bot2's turn 6 the hexproof is gone but the +2/+2 stays. CR 702.11b, 611.2b.

